<title>USA: GTE Corp gets U.S. Air Force contracts.</title>
<headline>GTE Corp gets U.S. Air Force contracts.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Corp on Monday said it has been awarded a contract worth up to $400 million by the U.S. Air Force for engineering and operational support of management information systems at command posts across the U.S.</p>
<p>GTE will provide infrastructure support at 20 Air Force Materiel Command sites. The contract is expected to be completed in November 2001.</p>
<p>The contract's total value depends on the number of task orders at each location, GTE said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
